      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Core Reasoning System\n\n• Standalone LM with pre-trained knowledge\n• No tools, memory, or live data access\n• Can explain concepts but blind to real-time events\n• Example: Can't report last night's game score",
