      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Connected Problem-Solver\n\n• Adds external tools (APIs, databases, functions)\n• Uses 5-step loop: Mission → Think → Act → Observe\n• Can fetch real-time data and interact with world\n• Example: Uses search API for live game scores",
