      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Strategic Problem-Solver\n\n• Adds orchestration layer with planning & memory\n• Context engineering: curates relevant information\n• Multi-step planning with stateful reasoning\n• Example: Find midpoint between offices → search\n  coffee shops → filter by rating → synthesize results",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Strategic Problem-Solver\n\n• Adds orchestration layer with planning & memory\n• Context engineering: curates relevant information\n• Multi-step planning with stateful reasoning\n• Example: Find midpoint between offices → search\n  coffee shops → filter by rating → synthesize results",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 154
    },
